cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EU AI Act: wo anfangen"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as part of the SimpleAct AI Governance Framework."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: SimpleAct-Compliance
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimpleAct-Compliance/simpleact-ai-act-compliance-guide"
license: MIT
abstract: "A sequenced entry path into Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 for organisations whose available capacity is one person, part-time. Orders the obligations by what is already applicable — Art. 5 and Art. 4 since 2025-02-02, Art. 50 since 2026-08-02 — against what the Digital Omnibus deferred to 2027-12-02, with effort estimates per phase, the eight misconceptions that waste the most time, and the single factual question that surfaces the Art. 25 cases nobody submitted for review."
keywords:
  - EU AI Act
  - GDPR
  - compliance roadmap
  - SME
  - Digital Omnibus
  - Article 50
  - Article 25
  - Annex III
  - AI governance
  - SimpleAct
